  },
  "subQuests": [
    {
      "subId": "7724001",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "772400101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "772400101": {
            "id": "772400101",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "NPC#22770",
            "text": "Anyone up for a challenge? One that'll train your eye at the same time? Beat the challenge, and this amazing chest over here is yours~",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "772400102"
            ]
          },
          "772400102": {
            "id": "772400102",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "We are! We're ready to take on the challenge!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "772400103"
            ]
          },
          "772400103": {
            "id": "772400103",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "NPC#22770",
            "text": "Oh...? Wonderful. I am Kruzhkova. How about the two of you?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "772400104"
            ]
          },
          "772400104": {
            "id": "772400104",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "#My name's Paimon, and this is {NICKNAME}.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "772400105"
            ]
          },
          "772400105": {
            "id": "772400105",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "NPC#22770",
            "text": "#Okay, okay, Paimon and {NICKNAME}. I got it.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "772400106"
            ]
          },
          "772400106": {
            "id": "772400106",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "...So eh, the \"generous rewards\" you were talking about, the chest — how do we get our hands on that?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "772400107"
            ]
          },
          "772400107": {
            "id": "772400107",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "NPC#22770",
            "text": "Oh, that's easy! First, please take a look at this next to me.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "772400109",
              "772400111"
            ]
          },
          "772400109": {
            "id": "772400109",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Do you really have to act so surprised...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "772400113"
            ]
          },
          "772400113": {
            "id": "772400113",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "NPC#22770",
            "text": "Yes, that's what it looks like, doesn't it? Just an ordinary old train. It's actually a piece of jun—— ahem, we picked up from the train boneyard, and for a pretty penny, too...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "772400114"
            ]
          },
          "772400114": {
            "id": "772400114",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "NPC#22770",
            "text": "But that's beside the point. Anyway, this may look like an ordinary train to you, but it's actually a \"Jack Frost train\"...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "772400115"
            ]
          },
          "772400115": {
            "id": "772400115",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "A Jack Frost train?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "772400116"
            ]
          },
          "772400116": {
            "id": "772400116",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "So, is it the chassis that's made by Jack Frosts, are we talking about the wheels here...?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "772400117"
            ]
          },
          "772400117": {
            "id": "772400117",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "NPC#22770",
            "text": "No, no, no. It's a train packed full of Jack Frosts. Mind you, it took me quite a bit of effort to catch... er, I mean invite all these Jack Frosts from all over...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "772400118"
            ]
          },
          "772400118": {
            "id": "772400118",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "NPC#22770",
            "text": "Anyway, the challenge is a simple one: all you have to do is drive the train out. I'll start my countdown, and you have to count exactly how many Jack Frosts there are on the train before it ends!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "772400119"
            ]
          },
          "772400119": {
            "id": "772400119",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "NPC#22770",
            "text": "So, what do you think? Up for training your eye? But because acquiring that train and setting up the venue has cost quite a bit, there's actually a fee if you wanna take part.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "772400120"
            ]
          },
          "772400120": {
            "id": "772400120",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "NPC#22770",
            "text": "But at 1,000 Mora a try, it really is quite a steal.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "772400121"
            ]
          },
          "772400121": {
            "id": "772400121",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Ohhhhhhhhh. So it's that kind of challenge, huh...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "772400122"
            ]
          },
          "772400122": {
            "id": "772400122",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "NPC#22770",
            "text": "So, how about it? Wanna give it a go?"
          },
          "772400111": {
            "id": "772400111",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Does such a thing even exist...?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "772400112"
            ]
          },
          "772400112": {
            "id": "772400112",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "This looks like just an ordinary train to Paimon!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7724010",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "772400501"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "772400501": {
            "id": "772400501",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "NPC#22770",
            "text": "Come try the \"Count the Jack Frosts\" challenge! Only 1,000 Mora a try! You get a generous reward if you win!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "772400503",
              "772400508"
            ]
          },
          "772400503": {
            "id": "772400503",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "#1,000 Mora, you said? Paimon will pay that on {NICKNAME}'s behalf! And if we really get that reward later...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "772400504"
            ]
          },
          "772400504": {
            "id": "772400504",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "NPC#22770",
            "text": "I'm sure you will, my dear little adorable miss. You remind me of a Jack Frost yourself!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "772400505"
            ]
          },
          "772400505": {
            "id": "772400505",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "#Awesome! And when we get that reward later, {NICKNAME}, you're buying Paimon something yummy!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "772400506"
            ]
          },
          "772400506": {
            "id": "772400506",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "NPC#22770",
            "text": "Okay then. Now, would the two of you stand over there please... The challenge is about to begin."
          },
          "772400508": {
            "id": "772400508",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "NPC#22770",
            "text": "Oh, that's a pity. But that's alright, I'll be here for a while still. Remember to come back when you've got some time!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7724002",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "772400201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "772400201": {
            "id": "772400201",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "NPC#22770",
            "text": "So, how did it go? Did you manage to count them? So, um, how many of those... of that kind of Jack Frosts do you think you saw?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "772400208",
              "772400209"
            ]
          },
          "772400208": {
            "id": "772400208",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "NPC#22770",
            "text": "Oh no! I'm afraid you got the number wrong. Looks like you missed out on that reward."
          },
          "772400209": {
            "id": "772400209",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "NPC#22770",
            "text": "Oh dear, I'm afraid you got the number wrong! Maybe you didn't hear me clearly just now — I did not ask how many Jack Frosts there are on the train earlier.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "772400210"
            ]
          },
          "772400210": {
            "id": "772400210",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "NPC#22770",
            "text": "I asked you to tell me how many Jack Frosts of that type... the ones with the hats on... you saw on the train.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "772400211"
            ]
          },
          "772400211": {
            "id": "772400211",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "NPC#22770",
            "text": "Looks like you missed out on that reward.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "772400212"
            ]
          },
          "772400212": {
            "id": "772400212",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Whaaat!? What kind of a... You should've started it more clearly just now!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "772400213"
            ]
          },
          "772400213": {
            "id": "772400213",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "NPC#22770",
            "text": "Oh, you should have chewed on it a little more.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "772400214"
            ]
          },
          "772400214": {
            "id": "772400214",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "F—fine! We'll try again then! And this time, we'll definitely get it right!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "772400215"
            ]
          },
          "772400215": {
            "id": "772400215",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "NPC#22770",
            "text": "So, the fee...?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "772400216"
            ]
          },
          "772400216": {
            "id": "772400216",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Paimon will pay it! Hmph, now that we know you only want us to count the Jack Frosts wearing hats, we won't get it wrong this time!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "772400217"
            ]
          },
          "772400217": {
            "id": "772400217",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "NPC#22770",
            "text": "Wow, what a generous challenger you are! I wish you every success in that case then..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7724004",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "772400401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "772400401": {
            "id": "772400401",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Black Screen",
            "text": "Thankfully, the fraud has not gotten far, and the two of you catch up with her and bring her back to the train..",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "772400402"
            ]
          },
          "772400402": {
            "id": "772400402",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "I want all my Mora back!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "772400403"
            ]
          },
          "772400403": {
            "id": "772400403",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "You horrible, horrible cheat!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "772400404"
            ]
          },
          "772400404": {
            "id": "772400404",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "NPC#22770",
            "text": "I'm sorry, I was wrong... I didn't think you'd catch up with me...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "772400405"
            ]
          },
          "772400405": {
            "id": "772400405",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "NPC#22770",
            "text": "Please, forgive me! Honestly, I haven't conned that many people!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "772400406"
            ]
          },
          "772400406": {
            "id": "772400406",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "What the...! Just exactly how many people were you planning to con!?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "772400407"
            ]
          },
          "772400407": {
            "id": "772400407",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Just one is bad enough!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "772400408"
            ]
          },
          "772400408": {
            "id": "772400408",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "NPC#22770",
            "text": "*Wail* I—I—I won't do it again! Promise!!!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "772400409"
            ]
          },
          "772400409": {
            "id": "772400409",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "NPC#22770",
            "text": "I used to be an Adventurers' Guild member myself, you know. And there was this one time, when I encountered a pack of Fluffahogs amidst a snowy night on the tundra.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "772400410"
            ]
          },
          "772400410": {
            "id": "772400410",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "NPC#22770",
            "text": "They came rolling on, like a cannonball made of giant spikes, and I was left a right sobbing mess by the end of the chase...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "772400411"
            ]
          },
          "772400411": {
            "id": "772400411",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "NPC#22770",
            "text": "Ever since then, I've sworn to myself that I'd sca—— earn enough Mora to pay other adventurers to drive every last one of those Fluffahogs away...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "772400412"
            ]
          },
          "772400412": {
            "id": "772400412",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "But there are so many honest ways you can earn Mora... And what about those Jack Frosts on the train?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "772400413"
            ]
          },
          "772400413": {
            "id": "772400413",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "NPC#22770",
            "text": "I told them that they could find yummy food on the train, and they came pouring in...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "772400414"
            ]
          },
          "772400414": {
            "id": "772400414",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Oh. Paimon sees how they could've fallen for that, yeah. Don't you dare cheat anyone else from now on! And let those Jack Frosts go!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "772400415"
            ]
          },
          "772400415": {
            "id": "772400415",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "NPC#22770",
            "text": "Y—Yes...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "772400416"
            ]
          },
          "772400416": {
            "id": "772400416",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Black Screen",
            "text": "The cheat known as Kruzhkova releases the Jack Frosts.\\nShe also promises again and again to never defraud others again and to engage in only honest work from now on...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "772400417"
            ]
          },
          "772400417": {
            "id": "772400417",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Black Screen",
            "text": "It is only at this point that the Jack Frosts realize that they were lied to.\\nTo thank you for rescuing them, they hand you some shiny buttons.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "772400418"
            ]
          },
          "772400418": {
            "id": "772400418",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Um... These buttons, are the Jack Frosts giving them to us to thank us?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "772400419"
            ]
          },
          "772400419": {
            "id": "772400419",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Ugh! It makes Paimon so mad, just thinking about that cheat... And those Jack Frosts! Paimon hopes they never get conned like that again!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7724005",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "772400301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "772400301": {
            "id": "772400301",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "NPC#22770",
            "text": "So, how did it go? Did you manage to count them? So, um, how many Jack Frosts wearing hats do you think you saw?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "772400303",
              "772400307",
              "772400311"
            ]
          },
          "772400303": {
            "id": "772400303",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "NPC#22770",
            "text": "*Sigh* You were so, so close...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "772400304"
            ]
          },
          "772400304": {
            "id": "772400304",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hmm... Paimon thinks something isn't quite right here! No, let's give it another try!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "772400305"
            ]
          },
          "772400305": {
            "id": "772400305",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "NPC#22770",
            "text": "Alright, alright. Now that you've paid the fee, you may continue..."
          },
          "772400307": {
            "id": "772400307",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "NPC#22770",
            "text": "*Sigh* You were so, so close...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "772400308"
            ]
          },
          "772400308": {
            "id": "772400308",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hmm... Paimon thinks something isn't quite right here! No, let's give it another try!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "772400309"
            ]
          },
          "772400309": {
            "id": "772400309",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "NPC#22770",
            "text": "Alright, alright. Now that you've paid the fee, you may continue..."
          },
          "772400311": {
            "id": "772400311",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "NPC#22770",
            "text": "Hmm... So what's the correct answer...?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "772400312"
            ]
          },
          "772400312": {
            "id": "772400312",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Well, this time round Paimon decided to count them for herself too! There are 5 Jack Frosts on the train that were wearing hats! And that's exactly what you said just now: \"Jack Frosts wearing hats\"!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "772400313"
            ]
          },
          "772400313": {
            "id": "772400313",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "NPC#22770",
            "text": "Yes! The correct answer is... 5!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "772400314"
            ]
          },
          "772400314": {
            "id": "772400314",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "NPC#22770",
            "text": "In that case, here's your challenge reward! And please excuse me, for I have to go now!"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}